Hi there! 

Before we knew it, the time had passed, and now there are only 2 days left until SuchArt finally gets released — yay! 

It was a quick reminder that the release is literally around the corner, that you should wishlist the game, save up some pocket money and all that, but today we’ve actually got something else we’d also like to talk about.

https://store.steampowered.com/app/1293180/SuchArt_Genius_Artist_Simulator/

As you probably know, we ran a painting contest that ended on Jul 10. Its theme was «Describe SuchArt in one painting to your gaming friend». And well, now’s the time to announce our winners (we’ve already done it on Twitter, but not everyone’s using it, right?). Here are 10 works that (hopefully) will remind you why you should be waiting for SuchArt — hope you enjoy them! 

